# Description: Detects suspicious service installation scripts
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((ImagePath:*cscript* OR ImagePath:*mshta* OR ImagePath:*powershell* OR ImagePath:*pwsh* OR ImagePath:*regsvr32* OR ImagePath:*rundll32* OR ImagePath:*wscript*)) AND ((ImagePath:* -c * OR ImagePath:* -r * OR ImagePath:* -k *)) AND (winlog.provider_name:"Service Control Manager" AND winlog.event_id:"7045"))
